@startuml Database Schema - Smart-Contract Pattern (Layered)
!theme vibrant

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 100
skinparam ranksep 80
skinparam roundcorner 8

title Database Schema - Smart-Contract Pattern\n(Contract-First Architecture: Cleaner, Safer, More Efficient)

' ============================================
' LAYER 1: OXID CORE (TOP - READ ONLY)
' ============================================

package "LAYER 1: OXID Core (Read-Only - No Modifications)" <<Rectangle>> #E8F5E9 {

  entity "oxuser" as USER {
    * OXID : CHAR(32) <<PK>>
    --
    OXUSERNAME : VARCHAR(255)
    OXEMAIL : VARCHAR(255)
    OXFNAME, OXLNAME
    ...30+ fields
    --
    <color:red>NO CHANGES</color>
  }

  entity "oxorder" as ORDER {
    * OXID : CHAR(32) <<PK>>
    --
    OXUSERID : CHAR(32) <<FK>>
    OXORDERNR : INT
    OXORDERDATE : DATETIME
    --
    OXPAID : DATETIME
    OXTRANSSTATUS : VARCHAR(32)
    OXTOTALORDERSUM : DECIMAL
    --
    ...40+ fields
    --
    <color:red>NO CHANGES</color>
  }

  USER -down- ORDER
}

' ============================================
' LAYER 2: CONTRACT LAYER (MIDDLE - NEW!)
' ============================================

package "LAYER 2: Contract Layer (NEW - Aggregate Root)" <<Rectangle>> #F3E5F5 {

  entity "osc_payment_contract" as CONTRACT {
    * OXID : CHAR(32) <<PK>>
    ==
    <color:blue>**References**</color>
    OXUSERID : CHAR(32) <<FK>>
    **OXORDERID : CHAR(32) <<FK>> = NULL!**
    ==
    <color:orange>**State Machine**</color>
    **OXSTATE** : VARCHAR(32)
    OXSTATEREASON : VARCHAR(255)
    ==
    <color:purple>**Immutable Snapshot (JSON)**</color>
    **OXBASKETDATA** : JSON
    OXTERMS : JSON
    ==
    <color:green>**Conditions (JSON)**</color>
    **OXCONDITIONS** : JSON
    ==
    <color:brown>**Provider Integration**</color>
    OXPROVIDER : VARCHAR(32)
    **OXPROVIDERORDERID** : VARCHAR(128)
    ==
    <color:gray>**Lifecycle Timestamps**</color>
    OXCREATED, OXUPDATED
    OXCOMMITTEDAT
    OXFULFILLEDAT
    OXEXPIRESAT
    ==
    <color:teal>**Critical Indexes**</color>
    IDX(OXSTATE)
    IDX(OXPROVIDERORDERID) ★
    IDX(OXSTATE, OXEXPIRESAT)
  }
}

' ============================================
' LAYER 3: COMPONENT LAYER (BOTTOM)
' ============================================

package "LAYER 3: Component Layer (Modified - Contract-Aware)" <<Rectangle>> #FFF3E0 {

  entity "osc_payment_order_state" as STATE {
    * OXID : CHAR(32) <<PK>>
    --
    OXORDERID : CHAR(32) <<FK>> <<U>>
    **OXCONTRACTID : CHAR(32) <<FK>> NEW!**
    --
    OXPAYMENTSTATE : VARCHAR(32)
    OXPROVIDERORDERID : VARCHAR(128)
  }

  entity "osc_payment_transaction" as TX {
    * OXID : CHAR(32) <<PK>>
    --
    OXORDERID : CHAR(32) <<FK>>
    **OXCONTRACTID : CHAR(32) <<FK>> NEW!**
    --
    OXPROVIDERORDERID : VARCHAR(128)
    OXTRANSACTIONID : VARCHAR(128)
    OXPARENTTRANSACTIONID : CHAR(32)
    --
    OXTYPE : VARCHAR(32)
    OXSTATUS : VARCHAR(32)
    OXAMOUNT : DECIMAL(10,2)
  }

  STATE -right- TX
}

' ============================================
' LAYER 4: DETAIL TABLES (RIGHT SIDE)
' ============================================

package "LAYER 4: Detail Tables (1:1 Optional)" <<Rectangle>> #E3F2FD {

  entity "osc_payment_authorization_details" as AUTH {
    * OXID : CHAR(32) <<PK>>
    --
    OXTRANSACTIONID : CHAR(32) <<FK>> <<U>>
    --
    OXAUTHORIZATIONID : VARCHAR(128)
    OXAUTHORIZEDAMOUNT : DECIMAL
    OXCAPTUREDAMOUNT : DECIMAL
    OXREMAININGAMOUNT : DECIMAL
    OXEXPIRESAT : DATETIME
  }

  entity "osc_payment_refund_details" as REFUND {
    * OXID : CHAR(32) <<PK>>
    --
    OXTRANSACTIONID : CHAR(32) <<FK>> <<U>>
    --
    OXORIGINALAMOUNT : DECIMAL
    OXREFUNDAMOUNT : DECIMAL
    OXTOTALREFUNDED : DECIMAL
    OXREASON : VARCHAR(64)
  }

  entity "osc_payment_3ds_details" as TDS {
    * OXID : CHAR(32) <<PK>>
    --
    OXTRANSACTIONID : CHAR(32) <<FK>> <<U>>
    --
    OXREQUIRESACTION : BOOLEAN
    OXAUTHENTICATIONSTATUS : VARCHAR(32)
    OXLIABILITYSHIFTED : BOOLEAN
  }

  AUTH -down- REFUND
  REFUND -down- TDS
}

' ============================================
' RELATIONSHIPS (Clean vertical flow)
' ============================================

' Layer 1 → Layer 2 (Core to Contract)
USER ||--down--o{ CONTRACT : "creates (1:N)"

' Layer 2 → Layer 1 (Contract to Core - KEY!)
CONTRACT }o--up--|| ORDER : "commits to (0..1:1)\n**NULL until ready!**"

' Layer 1 → Layer 3 (Core to Component)
ORDER ||--down--|| STATE : "has state (1:1)"
ORDER ||--down--o{ TX : "has txs (1:N)"

' Layer 2 → Layer 3 (Contract to Component - NEW!)
CONTRACT ||--down--|| STATE : "links to (1:1)"
CONTRACT ||--down--o{ TX : "tracks (1:N)"

' Layer 3 → Layer 4 (Component to Details)
TX ||--right--o| AUTH : "auth (0..1:1)"
TX ||--right--o| REFUND : "refund (0..1:1)"
TX ||--right--o| TDS : "3DS (0..1:1)"

' Self-reference (Transaction parent-child)
TX ||--o{ TX : "parent-child"

' ============================================
' KEY INSIGHTS (Right side)
' ============================================

note right of CONTRACT
  **CONTRACT = AGGREGATE ROOT**

  **State Machine:**
  DRAFT → PENDING → READY_TO_COMMIT
    → COMMITTED → FULFILLED

  **Terminal States:**
  CANCELLED | EXPIRED | FAILED

  **KEY FIELD:**
  OXORDERID = **NULL** until committed!

  **When Order Created:**
  1. All conditions fulfilled
  2. Payment authorized
  3. Fraud check passed
  4. Stock reserved
  → THEN order created
  → OXORDERID set
  → OXSTATE = 'committed'
end note

note right of ORDER
  **ORDER = CREATED LATE**

  **Before Smart-Contract:**
  • Created on "Place Order" click
  • State: NOT_FINISHED
  • May never be paid
  • Clutters database

  **With Smart-Contract:**
  • Created when conditions met
  • State: NOT_FINISHED
  • Will be paid (guaranteed)
  • Clean database

  **Simpler States:**
  • NOT_FINISHED → OK
  • No intermediate payment states
end note

note bottom of CONTRACT
  **OXBASKETDATA (JSON):**
  {
    "items": [...],
    "discounts": [...],
    "totals": {
      "gross": 139.75,
      "currency": "EUR"
    }
  }

  **OXCONDITIONS (JSON):**
  [
    {
      "type": "payment_authorized",
      "status": "fulfilled",
      "data": {"authId": "auth_456"}
    },
    {
      "type": "fraud_check",
      "status": "fulfilled",
      "data": {"score": 98}
    }
  ]
end note

' ============================================
' EFFICIENCY COMPARISON (Bottom)
' ============================================

note as N_EFFICIENCY
  **EFFICIENCY GAINS:**

  **❌ OLD PATTERN (No Contract):**
  • Order created immediately
  • Payment fails → orphan order
  • Order number gaps
  • Complex rollback
  • State pollution (500, 600, 700, 800)

  **✅ NEW PATTERN (With Contract):**
  • Contract created first
  • Payment fails → no order created
  • Sequential order numbers
  • Simple cancellation
  • Clean states (DRAFT → FULFILLED)

  **Storage:**
  +10-15% database size
  (contract table + snapshots)

  **BUT:**
  • No orphan orders
  • Complete audit trail
  • Explicit conditions
  • Provider-agnostic
  • Better API semantics

  **Performance:**
  +50ms per checkout (~33% overhead)

  **Worth It?**
  ✅ YES for modern commerce
  ✅ YES for API-first
  ✅ YES for multi-step checkout
end note

note as N_FLOW
  **DATA FLOW (Step by Step):**

  **1. User clicks "Place Order"**
     → CONTRACT created (DRAFT)
     → OXORDERID = NULL
     → OXBASKETDATA = snapshot

  **2. Conditions added**
     → CONTRACT (PENDING)
     → OXCONDITIONS = [
         payment_authorized: pending,
         fraud_check: pending
       ]

  **3. Conditions fulfilled**
     → CONTRACT (READY_TO_COMMIT)
     → OXCONDITIONS = [
         payment_authorized: fulfilled ✓,
         fraud_check: fulfilled ✓
       ]

  **4. Order created**
     → ORDER created
     → CONTRACT (COMMITTED)
     → OXORDERID = 'order456' ✓

  **5. Payment captured**
     → CONTRACT (FULFILLED)
     → ORDER.oxpaid = NOW()
     → ORDER.oxtransstatus = 'OK'

  **Result:**
  Clean order, no gaps, full audit trail
end note

note as N_BENEFITS
  **WHY CONTRACT-FIRST?**

  ✅ **Cleaner Database**
  No orphan orders from failed payments

  ✅ **Better Rollback**
  Cancel contract vs delete order

  ✅ **Sequential Order Numbers**
  No gaps from failed payments

  ✅ **Explicit Conditions**
  Transparent payment lifecycle

  ✅ **Complete Audit Trail**
  Basket snapshot + conditions + timestamps

  ✅ **Provider-Agnostic**
  Stripe, PayPal, Adyen, Unzer, etc.

  ✅ **API-First Ready**
  Contract ID → Order ID (clear semantics)

  ✅ **Idempotent Webhooks**
  State machine prevents duplicates

  ✅ **Safer Checkout**
  All risks verified before order creation
end note

legend bottom center
  **LEGEND:**
  <color:red>**★**</color> = Critical index for webhook lookups
  <<U>> = UNIQUE constraint
  <<FK>> = Foreign key
  **NULL!** = Key innovation (OXORDERID = NULL until committed)

  **Color Code:**
  <color:#E8F5E9>Green</color> = OXID Core (no changes)
  <color:#F3E5F5>Purple</color> = Contract Layer (NEW)
  <color:#FFF3E0>Orange</color> = Component Layer (modified)
  <color:#E3F2FD>Blue</color> = Detail Tables (existing)
endlegend

@enduml
